        }
      ],
      "mistakes": [
        {
          "wrong": "하구거를 공부해요.",
          "right": "한국어를 공부해요.",
          "why_uz": "Talaffuz [한구거], yozuv 한국어.",
          "why_en": "It sounds like [한구거] but is spelled 한국어."
        },
        {
          "wrong": "으막을 좋아해요.",
          "right": "음악을 좋아해요.",
          "why_uz": "Talaffuz [으막], yozuv 음악.",
          "why_en": "It sounds like [으막] but is spelled 음악."
        },
        {
          "wrong": "조아요.",
          "right": "좋아요.",
          "why_uz": "ㅎ eshitilmaydi, lekin yoziladi: 좋아요.",
          "why_en": "The ㅎ is silent but written: 좋아요."
        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbek tilida ham so'zlar bog'lanadi: 'kitob oldim' ko'pincha [kitobo:ldim] eshitiladi. Koreyschada bu qoida doimiy: 받침 har doim keyingi unliga o'tadi.",
      "compare_en": "English links words too: 'an apple' sounds like 'a-napple'. In Korean this happens every time a 받침 meets a vowel: 음악 → [으막]."
    },
    {
      "id": "b1_u02_l1_g2",
      "pattern": "받침 talaffuzi (7 tovush)",
      "meaning_uz": "Bo'g'in oxirida faqat 7 xil tovush",
      "meaning_en": "Final consonants: only seven sounds",
      "explanation_md": "Bo'g'in **oxirida** ko'p 받침 bo'lsa ham, faqat **7 xil tovush** eshitiladi: **[ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ, ㅁ, ㅂ, ㅇ]**.\n\n| Yozuv | Talaffuz | Misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| ㄱ, ㅋ, ㄲ | [ㄱ] | 부엌 [부억], 밖 [박] |\n| ㄷ, ㅅ, ㅆ, ㅈ, ㅊ, ㅌ, ㅎ | [ㄷ] | 옷 [옫], 낮 [낟], 꽃 [꼳] |\n| ㅂ, ㅍ | [ㅂ] | 앞 [압], 잎 [입] |\n| ㄴ, ㄹ, ㅁ, ㅇ | o'zgarmaydi | 산, 물, 밤, 방 |\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Bu tovushlar **qisqa** va **havo chiqarmasdan** aytiladi.\n- Keyin unli kelsa, **bog'lanish** (연음) ishlaydi va asl harf eshitiladi: **옷** [옫], lekin **옷이** [오시].\n- Shuning uchun **꽃** va **꼳** bir xil eshitiladi — yozuvni yodlash kerak.",
      "explanation_md_en": "However many letters can stand as 받침, a syllable can only **end** in **seven sounds**: **[ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ, ㅁ, ㅂ, ㅇ]**.\n\n| Written | Sounds like | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| ㄱ, ㅋ, ㄲ | [ㄱ] | 부엌 [부억], 밖 [박] |\n| ㄷ, ㅅ, ㅆ, ㅈ, ㅊ, ㅌ, ㅎ | [ㄷ] | 옷 [옫], 낮 [낟], 꽃 [꼳] |\n| ㅂ, ㅍ | [ㅂ] | 앞 [압], 잎 [입] |\n| ㄴ, ㄹ, ㅁ, ㅇ | unchanged | 산, 물, 밤, 방 |\n\n### Remember\n\n- These final sounds are **short** and **unreleased** — no puff of air.\n- When a vowel follows, **linking** brings the real letter back: **옷** [옫], but **옷이** [오시].\n- So **꽃** and **꼳** sound the same — you need to learn the spelling.",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㄱ guruhi",
          "condition_en": "ㄱ group",
          "rule": "ㄱ, ㅋ, ㄲ → [ㄱ]",
          "example": "부엌 [부억], 밖 [박]"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㄷ guruhi",
          "condition_en": "ㄷ group",
          "rule": "ㄷ, ㅅ, ㅆ, ㅈ, ㅊ, ㅌ, ㅎ → [ㄷ]",
          "example": "옷 [옫], 꽃 [꼳], 낮 [낟]"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㅂ guruhi",
          "condition_en": "ㅂ group",
          "rule": "ㅂ, ㅍ → [ㅂ]",
          "example": "앞 [압], 잎 [입]"
        }
      ],
