      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada ham so'z oxirida tovush o'zgaradi: 'kitob' oxiri ko'pincha [p] kabi eshitiladi. Koreyschada bu qat'iy qoida: 7 xil oxirgi tovush.",
      "compare_en": "English has a similar effect: the 't' in 'cat' is often unreleased. In Korean it's a strict rule: syllables end in only seven sounds."
    }
